      "end_time": "2026-10-09T15:01:05.234000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Alex Rivera"
      },
      "text": "Look, I don't know if the bulk import is really the issue, for what it's worth.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-09T15:01:05.237000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-09T15:01:10.570000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Owen Price"
      },
      "text": "Oh, okay.",
