      "end_time": "2026-10-09T15:01:19.132000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Felix Moreau"
      },
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-09T15:01:19.154000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-09T15:01:19.754000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "So yeah, it feels like the reporting export and the email digests are kind of the same problem.",
