      "end_time": "2026-10-09T15:01:27.934000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Felix Moreau"
      },
      "text": "minutes if we clean up the backlog.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-09T15:01:27.981000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-09T15:01:30.315000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Felix Moreau"
      },
      "text": "And for Beacon Freight like specifically, the edge cases is on the critical path, right.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-09T15:01:31.151000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-09T15:01:36.151000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker"
      },
      "text": "No, totally.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-09T15:01:36.935000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-09T15:01:37.602000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Gotcha.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-09T15:01:37.656000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-09T15:01:38.256000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Look, I wouldn't block on the process, but yeah. And if we clean up the backlog, then the help center articles gets a lot easier",
      "start_time": "2026-10-09T15:01:38.301000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-09T15:01:46.634000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Owen Price"
      },
      "text": "True.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-09T15:01:43.832000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-09T15:01:44.432000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker"
      },
      "text": "Right, and Beacon Freight is kind of the test case for the requirements.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-09T15:01:46.823000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-09T15:01:51.156000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Yeah...",
      "start_time": "2026-10-09T15:01:51.183000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-09T15:01:51.783000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Did anyone else's internet die this morning?",
      "start_time": "2026-10-09T15:01:52.487000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-09T15:01:54.821000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Felix Moreau"
      },
      "text": "From my side, our solutions engineer mentioned the regional teams this morning, so it's on people's radar.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-09T15:01:54.840000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-09T15:02:00.507000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker"
      },
      "text": "Yeah, my worry with the trial period is that it just sits there.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-09T15:02:00.569000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-09T15:02:04.902000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Yeah, totally.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-09T15:02:03.047000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-09T15:02:03.647000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Felix Moreau"
      },
      "text": "The way I see it",
      "start_time": "2026-10-09T15:02:05.011000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-09T15:02:06.677000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker"
      },
      "text": "I'd love to start with the boring version",
