    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Felix Moreau"
      },
      "text": "but the permissions model is lower priority than we think.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-09T15:02:10.727000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-09T15:02:14.060000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Hmm.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-09T15:02:12.489000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-09T15:02:13.089000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Felix Moreau"
      },
      "text": "Also",
      "start_time": "2026-10-09T15:02:15.297000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-09T15:02:15.897000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Felix Moreau"
      },
      "text": "there's a world where we simplify it and the procurement steps just goes away.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-09T15:02:15.932000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-09T15:02:20.598000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Sounds good.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-09T15:02:18.394000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-09T15:02:18.994000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Felix Moreau"
      },
      "text": "I'm not convinced the edge cases is the scary part, if that helps.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-09T15:02:20.694000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-09T15:02:25.028000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Felix Moreau"
      },
      "text": "Anyway, I wouldn't block on the mobile adoption",
