      "end_time": "2026-10-09T15:02:47.748000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Felix Moreau"
      },
      "text": "Right, so I like don't know if the user provisioning is really the issue",
      "start_time": "2026-10-09T15:02:47.769000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-09T15:02:52.436000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Owen Price"
      },
      "text": "The way I see it, it's less about the champion on their side and more about the action items, too be honest.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-09T15:02:52.473000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-09T15:02:59.807000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Owen Price"
      },
      "text": "But it's funny",
      "start_time": "2026-10-09T15:03:00.426000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-09T15:03:01.426000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Owen Price"
      },
      "text": "the backlog looked low risk last week and now we're doing it two different ways.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-09T15:03:04.207000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-09T15:03:09.207000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Funny enough, the spreadsheet is not urgent, in my opinion.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-09T15:03:09.848000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-09T15:03:13.181000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Alex Rivera"
      },
      "text": "Right, and I feel like the sandbox account is good enough for now, or whatever.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-09T15:03:13.211000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-09T15:03:18.211000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Alex Rivera"
      },
      "text": "From my side,",
      "start_time": "2026-10-09T15:03:18.970000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-09T15:03:19.970000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Alex Rivera"
      },
      "text": "there's a world where we cut the scope and the regional teams just goes away.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-09T15:03:20.471000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-09T15:03:25.471000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Felix Moreau"
      },
      "text": "To be fair, I wouldn't block on the pilot group and stuff.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-09T15:03:25.507000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-09T15:03:29.507000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Well, I think the help center articles is fine for now and the edge cases is not urgent, so maybe keep it behind a flag. And the backlog came up on Friday too, to be honest.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-09T15:03:29.529000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-09T15:03:41.529000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "So on Beacon Freight, it's a lot cleaner now, at least for now.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-09T15:03:41.884000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-09T15:03:46.218000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Felix Moreau"
      },
      "text": "Actually, the annoying thing about the notification settings is it's um",
      "start_time": "2026-10-09T15:03:47.099000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-09T15:03:50.766000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Felix Moreau"
      },
      "text": "the blocker",
      "start_time": "2026-10-09T15:03:51.557000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-09T15:03:52.223000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Felix Moreau"
      },
      "text": "From my side,",
      "start_time": "2026-10-09T15:03:52.260000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-09T15:03:53.260000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Felix Moreau"
      },
      "text": "we should probably park it for now before we touch the metrics.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-09T15:03:53.294000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-09T15:03:57.294000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "So.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-09T15:03:57.889000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-09T15:03:58.489000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Oh, okay.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-09T15:03:58.539000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-09T15:03:59.206000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Felix Moreau"
      },
      "text": "Look, I think the feedback from their managers is way more complicated than it looks and the backlog is not where I'd want it, so maybe draw it on a whiteboard. Okay, I'm not convinced the change management piece is sort of on hold, which is fine.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-09T15:03:59.692000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-09T15:04:15.358000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Felix Moreau"
      },
      "text": "SSO ships with the Teams launch, so it'll be there before your December decision.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-09T15:04:15.456000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-09T15:04:20.123000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Owen Price"
      },
      "text": "Yeah...",
      "start_time": "2026-10-09T15:04:20.129000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-09T15:04:20.729000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Owen Price"
      },
      "text": "that's basically what we",
      "start_time": "2026-10-09T15:04:21.677000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-09T15:04:23.010000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Owen Price"
      },
      "text": "saw with the renewal conversation on Beacon Freight",
      "start_time": "2026-10-09T15:04:25.192000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-09T15:04:27.858000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Owen Price"
      },
      "text": "Oh, honestly the communication plan only needs about 30 tickets if we run it by support. I wouldn't block on the admin console, but yeah.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-09T15:04:27.893000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-09T15:04:36.226000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Alex Rivera"
      },
      "text": "Yeah, and can we get more data? Funny enough, I'm cautiously optimistic about the reporting export, right",
      "start_time": "2026-10-09T15:04:36.277000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-09T15:04:41.944000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Owen Price"
      },
      "text": "I mean.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-09T15:04:41.966000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-09T15:04:42.633000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Owen Price"
      },
      "text": "The short version is the like scope is like fine in theory, if that makes sense. But it feels like the training sessions and the onboarding calls are kind of the same problem.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-09T15:04:42.673000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-09T15:04:53.673000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "I feel like on Beacon Freight, it's mostly noise, I I mean, think",
      "start_time": "2026-10-09T15:04:53.677000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-09T15:04:58.011000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Oh, the feedback from their managers is sort of on hold, but the trial period is the scary part.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-09T15:04:59.817000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-09T15:05:06.151000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Yeah no, that's basically what we saw with the feedback from their managers on Beacon Freight.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-09T15:05:06.223000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-09T15:05:11.557000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Yeah, I think the timeline is in good shape and the admin console is mostly cosmetic, so maybe write it down.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-09T15:05:12.106000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-09T15:05:19.106000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Alex Rivera"
      },
      "text": "Right, right.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-09T15:05:15.793000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-09T15:05:16.393000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Anyway, for Beacon Freight, I think the onboarding calls is the part that's in good shape",
      "start_time": "2026-10-09T15:05:19.479000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-09T15:05:24.813000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Felix Moreau"
      },
      "text": "Mm.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-09T15:05:23.422000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-09T15:05:24.022000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "So if we timebox it",
      "start_time": "2026-10-09T15:05:24.818000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-09T15:05:26.485000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "then the handoff gets a lot easier.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-09T15:05:26.740000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-09T15:05:29.073000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "But part of me wants to clean up the backlog, part of me thinks it's the scary part.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-09T15:05:30.294000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-09T15:05:36.294000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Right, and I'd rather document the decision than split split it into two pieces.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-09T15:05:36.988000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-09T15:05:41.655000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Okay yeah, honestly the change management piece only needs eight screens if we clean up the backlog.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-09T15:05:41.686000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-09T15:05:47.353000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Alex Rivera"
      },
      "text": "Right, right.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-09T15:05:45.773000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-09T15:05:46.373000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "I mean.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-09T15:05:52.810000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-09T15:05:53.477000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "So does the contract redlines actually like matter for",
      "start_time": "2026-10-09T15:05:53.548000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-09T15:05:56.548000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Owen Price"
      },
      "text": "Fair.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-09T15:05:55.901000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-09T15:05:56.501000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Beacon Freight?",
      "start_time": "2026-10-09T15:05:58.157000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-09T15:05:58.824000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "And then part of me wants to do it properly, part of me thinks it's a little behind.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-09T15:05:58.902000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-09T15:06:04.902000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Owen Price"
      },
      "text": "We lost 10 minutes on the action items the other day, anyway.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-09T15:06:14.133000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-09T15:06:18.133000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Alex Rivera"
      },
      "text": "I talked to the design team about the integration with their HR system and they were pretty chill about it.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-09T15:06:18.147000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-09T15:06:24.813000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Alex Rivera"
      },
      "text": "But we've been saying we'd split it into two pieces for for a while,",
      "start_time": "2026-10-09T15:06:24.842000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-09T15:06:29.509000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Alex Rivera"
      },
      "text": "which is fine.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-09T15:06:29.518000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-09T15:06:30.518000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Um, did anyone look at the original proposal on Friday?",
      "start_time": "2026-10-09T15:06:30.610000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-09T15:06:33.943000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Felix Moreau"
      },
      "text": "Okay.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-09T15:06:34.006000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-09T15:06:34.606000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Felix Moreau"
      },
      "text": "I'd rather cut the scope than check with legal, you know what I mean. Anyway, it's like like, the onboarding calls is way more complicated than it looks and nobody wants to say like it.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-09T15:06:34.684000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-09T15:06:46.351000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Owen Price"
      },
      "text": "One more, we need our data stored in the EU. Is that possible?",
      "start_time": "2026-10-09T15:06:46.830000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-09T15:06:51.163000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Exactly.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-09T15:06:50.082000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-09T15:06:50.682000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Felix Moreau"
      },
      "text": "Ha, yeah.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-09T15:06:51.225000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-09T15:06:51.892000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Alex Rivera"
      },
      "text": "From my side, I'm kind of torn about the mobile adoption. My worry with the doc is that we're solving the wrong problem.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-09T15:06:52.046000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-09T15:06:59.713000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Um.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-09T15:06:59.811000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-09T15:07:00.411000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Nice.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-09T15:07:01.934000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-09T15:07:02.534000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "But I like think the legal review is pretty close and the audit trail is kind of fragile like honestly, so maybe cut the like scope.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-09T15:07:03.456000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-09T15:07:12.123000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker"
      },
      "text": "Cool.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-09T15:07:07.913000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-09T15:07:08.513000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Okay, I'd love to get a second opinion, but the original proposal is half done.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-09T15:07:12.563000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-09T15:07:17.563000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Alex Rivera"
      },
      "text": "Okay, honestly the pilot you know, group only needs two days if we map out the edge cases.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-09T15:07:17.600000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-09T15:07:23.600000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Yeah, yeah, it's funny, the training sessions looked pretty close a while back and now it was slower than I expected.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-09T15:07:23.631000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-09T15:07:30.631000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Alex Rivera"
      },
      "text": "Yeah, totally.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-09T15:07:28.300000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-09T15:07:28.900000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Owen Price"
      },
      "text": "The way I see it, it's like, the follow ups is still pretty rough and nobody wants to say it.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-09T15:07:30.712000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-09T15:07:37.379000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker"
      },
      "text": "Sorry, we've been saying we'd map out the edge cases for a while, but yeah.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-09T15:07:37.438000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-09T15:07:42.438000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "And.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-09T15:07:42.502000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-09T15:07:43.102000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Honestly, honestly the usage reports only needs most of the afternoon if we park it for now.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-09T15:07:43.130000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-09T15:07:48.797000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Alex Rivera"
      },
      "text": "Let me check with the team and get back to you.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-09T15:07:48.828000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-09T15:07:52.494000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Felix Moreau"
      },
      "text": "And.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-09T15:07:52.511000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-09T15:07:53.111000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Felix Moreau"
      },
      "text": "Wait, really?",
      "start_time": "2026-10-09T15:07:53.120000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-09T15:07:53.786000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Oh, nice.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-09T15:07:53.828000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-09T15:07:54.495000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Alex Rivera"
      },
      "text": "Okay, the thing I'd push on is the scope, I mean, I think. Beacon Freight is kind of the test case for the email digests, honestly.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-09T15:07:54.530000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-09T15:08:03.197000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Okay.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-09T15:08:01.949000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-09T15:08:02.549000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Okay.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-09T15:08:04.669000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-09T15:08:05.269000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Just to add, I talked to people on the other team about the dependencies and they were surprised. Well, I think the risk is dependencies on other teams, anyway.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-09T15:08:05.289000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-09T15:08:14.956000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Owen Price"
      },
      "text": "So the short version is the pilot group is unclear, I don't no.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-09T15:08:15.452000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-09T15:08:19.786000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Alex Rivera"
      },
      "text": "And...",
      "start_time": "2026-10-09T15:08:19.796000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-09T15:08:20.396000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Alex Rivera"
      },
      "text": "We keep going back and forth on the mobile adoption,",
      "start_time": "2026-10-09T15:08:20.428000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-09T15:08:23.762000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Alex Rivera"
      },
      "text": "to be like honest",
      "start_time": "2026-10-09T15:08:25.013000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-09T15:08:26.346000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker"
      },
      "text": "Anyway, if we map out the edge cases, then the success plan gets a lot easier...",
      "start_time": "2026-10-09T15:08:36.110000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-09T15:08:41.444000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Okay.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-09T15:08:41.534000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-09T15:08:42.134000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Same.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-09T15:08:42.173000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-09T15:08:42.773000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Right.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-09T15:08:42.797000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-09T15:08:43.397000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Right, so I was looking at the feedback last week and it's a lot cleaner now, more or less. And part of me wants to look at it with fresh eyes, part of me thinks it's the obvious next thing.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-09T15:08:43.495000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-09T15:08:56.828000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Owen Price"
      },
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-09T15:08:56.887000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-09T15:08:57.487000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Owen Price"
      },
      "text": "So I'm not convinced like the champion on their side is kind of a mystery, if that makes sense. But did anyone look at the edge cases after standup?",
      "start_time": "2026-10-09T15:08:57.712000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-09T15:09:07.379000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "No, totally.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-09T15:09:05.317000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-09T15:09:05.917000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Felix Moreau"
      },
      "text": "I think the risk is that it just sits there, I don't know. That's basically what we like saw with the kickoff deck on Beacon Freight. Yeah, so I keep coming back to the risks, in my opinion. Anyway, I feel like the next steps is unclear. Sorry, it's funny, the user provisioning looked a moving target a while back and now there were way more edge cases than I expected. And it's funny, the contract redlines looked low risk yesterday and now it's better than it was. Yeah. the short version is the trial period is the blocker.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-09T15:09:07.387000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-09T15:09:40.387000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Alex Rivera"
      },
      "text": "Great, that's it from me. Talk soon.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-09T15:09:41.826000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-09T15:09:44.159000Z"
